{"1678030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Burn Me Alive", "steam_appid": 1678030, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<i>The first collaboration of two indie developers, Burn Me Alive takes players on a dark journey that starts with the personal tragedy of the protagonist in a 1977 Tennessee and evolves into an investigation of its own story. The atmosphere is grimy and dark with a twist of strange, nightmarish sensations and occult symbolism.</i>   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/68d89c0c610308b18ff383312f712287.poster.avif?t=1771309323\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/68d89c0c610308b18ff383312f712287.webm?t=1771309323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/68d89c0c610308b18ff383312f712287.mp4?t=1771309323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Put clues together and uncover mysteries<br></li><li>Shoot or sneak past adversaries, use the environment to stall them if they chase you<br></li><li>Gain abilities as you progress</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/8096594606dff8c3454f3b9e4e8652a2.poster.avif?t=1771309323\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/8096594606dff8c3454f3b9e4e8652a2.webm?t=1771309323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678030/extras/8096594606dff8c3454f3b9e4e8652a2.mp4?t=1771309323\" type=\"video